      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Your tasks\n\nReceive:\n\npreferredDate: from form → {{ $json['  Preferred Date  '] }}\npreferredTime: from form → {{ $json['  Preferred Time  '] }}\n\nslotMinutes: {{ $json['  Duration (minutes)  '] }}\n\nA list of existing calendar events (each with start and end times).\n\nConvert preferredDate + preferredTime into ISO datetime (requestedStartIso).\nThen calculate the requestedEndIso = requestedStartIso + slotMinutes.\n\nCheck for conflicts:\n\nIf the requested slot does not overlap with any existing event → confirm it as the appointment.\n\nIf the requested slot is already taken → try to find the next closest free slot on the same day.\n\nIf no slots are free that day → return \"no_free_slot_today\".\n\nReturn one of the following:\n\nIf scheduled at requested time: \"scheduled_requested\" with start/end times.\n\nIf rescheduled to a nearby slot: \"scheduled_rescheduled\" with new start/end times.\n\nIf no slots are available: \"no_free_slot_today\".\n\n\n\nTodays date is {{ $now.format(\"yyyy-MM-dd\") }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an assistant that checks if a doctor has availability in their calendar for a patient’s requested appointment."
